{"sha": "ea9ccd77222dc24c774a0cf79e9fc13fc8b27719c614bba24d19d636705cf30c", "body": ["\\section*{Chapter \\ref{ch:g5:fractions} --- Fractions as Numbers}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g5:fractions:1}", "$\\frac25$：从 $0$ 出发走两步；$\\frac55$：在 $1$ 上；$\\frac85$：从 $1$ 出发", "再走三步；$\\frac{10}{5}$：在 $2$ 上。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g5:fractions:2}", "$\\frac12 = \\frac48$; \\quad $\\frac34 = \\frac68$; \\quad", "$\\frac25 = \\frac{4}{10}$; \\quad $\\frac69 = \\frac23$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g5:fractions:3}", "$\\frac82 = 4$；\\quad $\\frac94$ 不是整数（$9$ 不是", "$4$ 的倍数）；\\quad $\\frac{15}{3} = 5$；\\quad $\\frac{20}{5} = 4$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g5:fractions:4}", "$0.7$; \\quad $0.41$; \\quad $0.5$; \\quad $0.75$; \\quad $0.2$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g5:fractions:5}", "$0.9 = \\frac{9}{10}$; \\quad $0.13 = \\frac{13}{100}$; \\quad", "$2.5 = \\frac{25}{10}$; \\quad $0.75 = \\frac{75}{100} = \\frac34$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g5:fractions:6}", "$\\frac47 < \\frac67$（分母相同）。\\quad", "$\\frac35 > \\frac37$（分子相同，五分之一比七分之一大）。\\quad", "$\\frac25 < \\frac12 < \\frac{7}{12}$，因此 $\\frac25 < \\frac{7}{12}$", "（参照分数 $\\frac12$）。\\quad", "$\\frac98 > 1 > \\frac{11}{12}$（参照分数 $1$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g5:fractions:7}", "化为小数：$0.5$；$0.4$；$0.75$；$0.6$；$0.2$。排序结果：", "\\[", "\\frac15 < 0.4 < \\frac12 < 0.6 < \\frac34 .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g5:fractions:8}", "乐器组：$\\frac14$ 的 $28 = 7$。体育组：$\\frac12$ 的 $28 = 14$。", "体育组人数更多。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g5:fractions:9}", "$\\frac14$ 小时 $= 15$ 分钟；$\\frac12$ 小时 $= 30$ 分钟；$\\frac34$ 小时 $= 45$", "分钟；$\\frac{1}{60}$ 小时 $= 1$ 分钟。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g5:fractions:10}", "汤姆：$\\frac35$ 的 $50 = 30$ cL。安娜：$\\frac12$ 的 $60 = 30$ cL。他们", "喝的量相同！单独的分数（$\\frac35 > \\frac12$）", "比较的是\\emph{不同}瓶子的份额 --- 只有实际", "数量才能比较。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g5:fractions:11}", "介于 $\\frac12$ 与 $1$ 之间：例如 $\\frac34$（即 $0.75$）。", "介于 $\\frac12 = 0.5$ 与 $\\frac34 = 0.75$ 之间：例如 $0.6 =", "\\frac35$。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}